{"seq":1,"slug":"c-cpp-interop","title":"Nim C/C++ 互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/interop-performance/c-cpp-interop","wordCount":770,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"nim-c-c-互操作\">Nim C/C++ 互操作</h1><p>Nim 编译到 C（或 C++）的架构使其天然具备与现有 C/C++ 生态无缝互操作的能力。不需要编写绑定生成器或 FFI 胶水层——通过 pragma 注解直接在 Nim 代码中声明外部函数和类型，编译器生成正确的 C 代码调用它们。本文覆盖从简单的 C 函数调用到复杂的 C++ 类包装的完整技术栈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>importc/importcpp</strong>：声明外部 C/C++ 符号，编译器在生成代码中直接引用它们</li>\n<li><strong>header pragma</strong>：指定 C 头文件，使生成的代码自动 <code>#include</code></li>\n<li><strong>emit pragma</strong>：在生成代码中内联原始 C/C++ 代码片段，处理 pragma 无法表达的场景</li>\n<li><strong>类型映射</strong>：cint/cstring/pointer 等与 C 类型一一对应的兼容类型</li>\n<li><strong>内存布局控制</strong>：packed/align/union/bycopy 等注解确保 Nim 类型与 C 结构体二进制兼容</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"importc-调用-c-函数\">importc：调用 C 函数</h2><p><code>{.importc.}</code> pragma 告诉编译器「这个符号的实现来自 C」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"# 直接调用 C 标准库&#10;proc printf(format: cstring): cint {.importc, varargs, header: &quot;&lt;stdio.h&gt;&quot;.}&#10;proc malloc(size: csize_t): pointer {.importc, header: &quot;&lt;stdlib.h&gt;&quot;.}&#10;proc free(p: pointer) {.importc, header: &quot;&lt;stdlib.h&gt;&quot;.}&#10;&#10;# 调用 POSIX API&#10;proc getenv(name: cstring): cstring {.importc, header: &quot;&lt;stdlib.h&gt;&quot;.}&#10;&#10;let path = getenv(&quot;PATH&quot;)&#10;if path != nil:&#10;  echo &quot;PATH = &quot;, $path\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 直接调用 C 标准库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc printf(format: cstring): cint {.importc, varargs, header: \"&#x3C;stdio.h>\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc malloc(size: csize_t): pointer {.importc, header: \"&#x3C;stdlib.h>\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc free(p: pointer) {.importc, header: \"&#x3C;stdlib.h>\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 调用 POSIX API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc getenv(name: cstring): cstring {.importc, header: \"&#x3C;stdlib.h>\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let path = getenv(\"PATH\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if path != nil:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  echo \"PATH = \", $path</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键 pragma 组合：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Pragma</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>{.importc.}</code></td>\n<td>导入 C 函数</td>\n<td><code>proc strlen(s: cstring): csize_t {.importc.}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{.importc: &quot;alt_name&quot;.}</code></td>\n<td>导入时重命名</td>\n<td><code>proc nimSqrt(x: float): float {.importc: &quot;sqrt&quot;.}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{.header: &quot;x.h&quot;.}</code></td>\n<td>指定头文件</td>\n<td>使生成的 C 代码 <code>#include &quot;x.h&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{.varargs.}</code></td>\n<td>C 变参函数</td>\n<td>printf 风格函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{.cdecl.}</code></td>\n<td>调用约定</td>\n<td>默认即为 cdecl</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{.passL: &quot;-lm&quot;.}</code></td>\n<td>链接器标志</td>\n<td>链接数学库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{.passC: &quot;-I/path&quot;.}</code></td>\n<td>编译器标志</td>\n<td>添加包含路径</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"c-类型映射\">C 类型映射</h2><p>Nim 提供了与 C 类型一一对应的兼容类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"# Nim 类型 → C 类型映射&#10;type&#10;  CFile = object  # 不透明类型&#10;&#10;# 基础类型映射&#10;# cint      → int&#10;# cuint     → unsigned int&#10;# clong     → long&#10;# csize_t   → size_t&#10;# cfloat    → float&#10;# cdouble   → double&#10;# cstring   → char*&#10;# pointer   → void*&#10;# cchar     → char&#10;&#10;# 结构体映射——内存布局必须完全一致&#10;type&#10;  Timeval {.importc: &quot;struct timeval&quot;, header: &quot;&lt;sys/time.h&gt;&quot;.} = object&#10;    tv_sec: clong&#10;    tv_usec: clong&#10;&#10;  Stat {.importc: &quot;struct stat&quot;, header: &quot;&lt;sys/stat.h&gt;&quot;.} = object&#10;    st_size: int64&#10;    st_mode: uint32&#10;    # ... 其他字段\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Nim 类型 → C 类型映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  CFile = object  # 不透明类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 基础类型映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># cint      → int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># cuint     → unsigned int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># clong     → long</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># csize_t   → size_t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># cfloat    → float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># cdouble   → double</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># cstring   → char*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># pointer   → void*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># cchar     → char</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 结构体映射——内存布局必须完全一致</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Timeval {.importc: \"struct timeval\", header: \"&#x3C;sys/time.h>\".} = object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tv_sec: clong</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tv_usec: clong</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Stat {.importc: \"struct stat\", header: \"&#x3C;sys/stat.h>\".} = object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    st_size: int64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    st_mode: uint32</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    # ... 其他字段</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"importcpp-包装-c-类\">importcpp：包装 C++ 类</h2><p><code>{.importcpp.}</code> 支持完整的 C++ 语义——构造函数、方法调用、运算符重载、模板实例化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"{.passL: &quot;-lstdc++&quot;.}&#10;{.passC: &quot;-std=c++17&quot;.}&#10;&#10;# 包装 std::vector&#10;type&#10;  CppVector[T] {.importcpp: &quot;std::vector&quot;, header: &quot;&lt;vector&gt;&quot;.} = object&#10;&#10;proc newVector[T](): CppVector[T] {.importcpp: &quot;std::vector&lt;&#39;*0&gt;()&quot;, constructor.}&#10;proc push_back[T](v: var CppVector[T], item: T) {.importcpp: &quot;#.push_back(@)&quot;.}&#10;proc `[]`[T](v: CppVector[T], idx: int): T {.importcpp: &quot;#[#]&quot;.}&#10;proc size[T](v: CppVector[T]): csize_t {.importcpp: &quot;#.size()&quot;.}&#10;&#10;var vec = newVector[cint]()&#10;vec.push_back(10)&#10;vec.push_back(20)&#10;vec.push_back(30)&#10;echo vec[1]      # 20&#10;echo vec.size()  # 3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>{.passL: \"-lstdc++\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{.passC: \"-std=c++17\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 包装 std::vector</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  CppVector[T] {.importcpp: \"std::vector\", header: \"&#x3C;vector>\".} = object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc newVector[T](): CppVector[T] {.importcpp: \"std::vector&#x3C;'*0>()\", constructor.}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc push_back[T](v: var CppVector[T], item: T) {.importcpp: \"#.push_back(@)\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc `[]`[T](v: CppVector[T], idx: int): T {.importcpp: \"#[#]\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc size[T](v: CppVector[T]): csize_t {.importcpp: \"#.size()\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>var vec = newVector[cint]()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec.push_back(10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec.push_back(20)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec.push_back(30)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>echo vec[1]      # 20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>echo vec.size()  # 3</span></span></code></pre></div><p>importcpp 模式字符串语法：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;#&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;对象本身&quot;| B[&quot;v.method()&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;@&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;其余参数&quot;| D[&quot;method(arg1, arg2)&quot;]&#10;    E[&quot;&#39;0, &#39;1&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;泛型参数&quot;| F[&quot;vector&lt;int&gt;&quot;]&#10;    G[&quot;&#39;*0&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;具体化泛型&quot;| H[&quot;用于 constructor&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"#\"] --&gt;|\"对象本身\"| B[\"v.method()\"]\n    C[\"@\"] --&gt;|\"其余参数\"| D[\"method(arg1, arg2)\"]\n    E[\"'0, '1\"] --&gt;|\"泛型参数\"| F[\"vector&lt;int&gt;\"]\n    G[\"'*0\"] --&gt;|\"具体化泛型\"| H[\"用于 constructor\"]</pre><h2 id=\"emit-pragma-内联-c-c-代码\">emit Pragma：内联 C/C++ 代码</h2><p>当 pragma 不够表达复杂场景时，<code>{.emit.}</code> 允许直接嵌入目标语言代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"proc useInlineAsm(x: int): int =&#10;  var result: int&#10;  {.emit: &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    // 直接写 C 代码&#10;    `result` = `x` * `x` + 1;&#10;  &quot;&quot;&quot;.}&#10;  return result&#10;&#10;# C++ RAII 资源管理&#10;{.emit: &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;#include &lt;mutex&gt;&#10;static std::mutex globalMutex;&#10;&quot;&quot;&quot;.}&#10;&#10;proc withGlobalLock(body: proc()) =&#10;  {.emit: &quot;std::lock_guard&lt;std::mutex&gt; lock(globalMutex);&quot;.}&#10;  body()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>proc useInlineAsm(x: int): int =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var result: int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {.emit: \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 直接写 C 代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    `result` = `x` * `x` + 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  \"\"\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># C++ RAII 资源管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{.emit: \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#include &#x3C;mutex></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>static std::mutex globalMutex;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"\"\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc withGlobalLock(body: proc()) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {.emit: \"std::lock_guard&#x3C;std::mutex> lock(globalMutex);\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  body()</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>emit</code> 中使用反引号引用 Nim 变量——编译器会替换为对应的 C 变量名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"完整绑定示例-包装-sqlite3\">完整绑定示例：包装 SQLite3</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"const SqliteHeader = &quot;&lt;sqlite3.h&gt;&quot;&#10;&#10;{.passL: &quot;-lsqlite3&quot;.}&#10;&#10;type&#10;  Sqlite3 {.importc: &quot;sqlite3&quot;, header: SqliteHeader.} = object&#10;  Sqlite3Ptr = ptr Sqlite3&#10;  Sqlite3Stmt {.importc: &quot;sqlite3_stmt&quot;, header: SqliteHeader.} = object&#10;  StmtPtr = ptr Sqlite3Stmt&#10;&#10;const&#10;  SQLITE_OK = 0.cint&#10;  SQLITE_ROW = 100.cint&#10;  SQLITE_DONE = 101.cint&#10;&#10;proc sqlite3_open(filename: cstring, db: ptr Sqlite3Ptr): cint&#10;  {.importc, header: SqliteHeader.}&#10;proc sqlite3_close(db: Sqlite3Ptr): cint&#10;  {.importc, header: SqliteHeader.}&#10;proc sqlite3_prepare_v2(db: Sqlite3Ptr, sql: cstring, nByte: cint,&#10;    stmt: ptr StmtPtr, tail: ptr cstring): cint&#10;  {.importc, header: SqliteHeader.}&#10;proc sqlite3_step(stmt: StmtPtr): cint&#10;  {.importc, header: SqliteHeader.}&#10;proc sqlite3_column_text(stmt: StmtPtr, col: cint): cstring&#10;  {.importc, header: SqliteHeader.}&#10;proc sqlite3_finalize(stmt: StmtPtr): cint&#10;  {.importc, header: SqliteHeader.}&#10;&#10;# 高层 Nim 封装&#10;type Database = object&#10;  handle: Sqlite3Ptr&#10;&#10;proc open(path: string): Database =&#10;  var db: Sqlite3Ptr&#10;  let rc = sqlite3_open(path.cstring, addr db)&#10;  if rc != SQLITE_OK:&#10;    raise newException(IOError, &quot;Failed to open database&quot;)&#10;  Database(handle: db)&#10;&#10;proc close(db: var Database) =&#10;  if db.handle != nil:&#10;    discard sqlite3_close(db.handle)&#10;    db.handle = nil\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const SqliteHeader = \"&#x3C;sqlite3.h>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{.passL: \"-lsqlite3\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Sqlite3 {.importc: \"sqlite3\", header: SqliteHeader.} = object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Sqlite3Ptr = ptr Sqlite3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Sqlite3Stmt {.importc: \"sqlite3_stmt\", header: SqliteHeader.} = object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  StmtPtr = ptr Sqlite3Stmt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  SQLITE_OK = 0.cint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  SQLITE_ROW = 100.cint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  SQLITE_DONE = 101.cint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc sqlite3_open(filename: cstring, db: ptr Sqlite3Ptr): cint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {.importc, header: SqliteHeader.}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc sqlite3_close(db: Sqlite3Ptr): cint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {.importc, header: SqliteHeader.}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc sqlite3_prepare_v2(db: Sqlite3Ptr, sql: cstring, nByte: cint,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    stmt: ptr StmtPtr, tail: ptr cstring): cint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {.importc, header: SqliteHeader.}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc sqlite3_step(stmt: StmtPtr): cint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {.importc, header: SqliteHeader.}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc sqlite3_column_text(stmt: StmtPtr, col: cint): cstring</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {.importc, header: SqliteHeader.}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc sqlite3_finalize(stmt: StmtPtr): cint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {.importc, header: SqliteHeader.}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 高层 Nim 封装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type Database = object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  handle: Sqlite3Ptr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc open(path: string): Database =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  var db: Sqlite3Ptr</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let rc = sqlite3_open(path.cstring, addr db)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if rc != SQLITE_OK:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    raise newException(IOError, \"Failed to open database\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Database(handle: db)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc close(db: var Database) =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if db.handle != nil:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    discard sqlite3_close(db.handle)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    db.handle = nil</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"内存布局与对齐控制\">内存布局与对齐控制</h2><p>与 C 互操作时，内存布局必须精确匹配。Nim 提供了细粒度的控制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"type&#10;  # packed —— 消除填充字节&#10;  PacketHeader {.packed.} = object&#10;    version: uint8&#10;    flags: uint8&#10;    length: uint16&#10;    sequence: uint32&#10;&#10;  # 指定对齐&#10;  AlignedData {.align(16).} = object&#10;    values: array[4, float32]&#10;&#10;static:&#10;  assert sizeof(PacketHeader) == 8  # 无填充&#10;  assert sizeof(AlignedData) mod 16 == 0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # packed —— 消除填充字节</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  PacketHeader {.packed.} = object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    version: uint8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    flags: uint8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    length: uint16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sequence: uint32</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 指定对齐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  AlignedData {.align(16).} = object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    values: array[4, float32]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>static:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  assert sizeof(PacketHeader) == 8  # 无填充</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  assert sizeof(AlignedData) mod 16 == 0</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>注解</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>{.packed.}</code></td>\n<td>消除结构体内部的对齐填充</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{.align(N).}</code></td>\n<td>强制 N 字节对齐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{.size: N.}</code></td>\n<td>强制类型占 N 字节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{.union.}</code></td>\n<td>C union 语义（字段共享内存）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{.bycopy.}</code></td>\n<td>传值（而非传指针）给 C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{.byref.}</code></td>\n<td>传引用给 C</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Padding</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>sizeof</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>actual</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><mtext>sizeof</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Padding}(T) = \\text{sizeof}(T)_{\\text{actual}} - \\sum_{i} \\text{sizeof}(f_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Padding</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sizeof</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">actual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sizeof</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>在 <code>{.packed.}</code> 模式下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Padding</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Padding}(T) = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Padding</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，但访问未对齐字段可能有性能损失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"回调与导出-nim-函数给-c\">回调与导出 Nim 函数给 C</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"# 导出 Nim 函数供 C 调用&#10;proc nimCallback(data: pointer, len: cint): cint {.exportc, cdecl.} =&#10;  let nimStr = cast[ptr UncheckedArray[char]](data)&#10;  echo &quot;Received &quot;, len, &quot; bytes&quot;&#10;  return 0&#10;&#10;# 注册回调到 C 库&#10;type Callback = proc(data: pointer, len: cint): cint {.cdecl.}&#10;&#10;proc registerCallback(cb: Callback) {.importc, header: &quot;mylib.h&quot;.}&#10;registerCallback(nimCallback)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 导出 Nim 函数供 C 调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc nimCallback(data: pointer, len: cint): cint {.exportc, cdecl.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let nimStr = cast[ptr UncheckedArray[char]](data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  echo \"Received \", len, \" bytes\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 注册回调到 C 库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type Callback = proc(data: pointer, len: cint): cint {.cdecl.}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc registerCallback(cb: Callback) {.importc, header: \"mylib.h\".}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>registerCallback(nimCallback)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Nim 的 C/C++ 互操作是「编译到 C」架构带来的天然优势：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>importc/importcpp 使绑定声明比传统 FFI 生成器更简洁，一行 pragma 即可调用外部函数</li>\n<li>importcpp 的模式字符串语法完整支持 C++ 构造函数、方法、运算符和模板实例化</li>\n<li>emit 作为逃生舱处理少数无法用 pragma 表达的底层操作（内联汇编、复杂宏）</li>\n<li>packed/align/union 等布局控制使 Nim 类型可以与 C 网络协议结构体、硬件寄存器精确对齐</li>\n<li>exportc/dynlib 允许将 Nim 代码导出为 C 动态库，供其他语言调用</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关于 Nim 的另一个后端目标——JavaScript，参见 <a href=\"javascript-backend\">JavaScript 后端</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Nim C/C++ 互操作","id":"nim-c-c-互操作"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"importc：调用 C 函数","id":"importc-调用-c-函数"},{"level":2,"text":"C 类型映射","id":"c-类型映射"},{"level":2,"text":"importcpp：包装 C++ 类","id":"importcpp-包装-c-类"},{"level":2,"text":"emit Pragma：内联 C/C++ 代码","id":"emit-pragma-内联-c-c-代码"},{"level":2,"text":"完整绑定示例：包装 SQLite3","id":"完整绑定示例-包装-sqlite3"},{"level":2,"text":"内存布局与对齐控制","id":"内存布局与对齐控制"},{"level":2,"text":"回调与导出 Nim 函数给 C","id":"回调与导出-nim-函数给-c"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Nim Pragma 与效果系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/metaprogramming/pragmas-effects"},"next":{"title":"Nim JavaScript 后端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/interop-performance/javascript-backend"}}